WEBVTT

00:00:00.580 --> 00:00:03.300
Hi, I'm Tilly! Let's launch some programs.

00:00:04.614 --> 00:00:07.494
Alt space finds any program on your path.

00:00:08.078 --> 00:00:11.278
Tab opens it in a new pane, ready for arguments.

00:00:12.282 --> 00:00:15.642
tuios popup floats a picker over your panes.

00:00:16.435 --> 00:00:18.835
When the program exits, the popup closes.

00:00:19.476 --> 00:00:22.756
Control P finds commands, and panes in every session.

00:00:24.499 --> 00:00:27.139
Want to try it? The install guide is right here.
